    {
      "id": "claim_76c66b87e52242e6b6c3f5c02c571a7d",
      "statement": "Main-process capabilities are cordis `Service` plugins assembled by code in three functions: `createKernel` (all services in-process, the assembly the offline suite loads), `createDataplaneKernel` (only the four collection services, used by the utilityProcess child entry) and `createPanelKernel` (the Electron production assembly, which registers no collection service at all).",
