      "id": "claim_b5c3ca5f86ed4dd4be384ef0f7bbc80b",
      "statement": "No module the offline suite loads may import `electron` at module scope: `kernel.ts` stays Electron-free, the Electron-only wiring lives in separate files (`panel-kernel.ts`, `services/dataplane.ts`), and Windows/Electron access otherwise goes through adapters that bind koffi or `require('electron')` lazily inside the functions that need them and have non-Electron fallbacks — so a service added to `createKernel` must receive its real sources as injected dependencies.",
