      "id": "claim_20a5b797deb2417aa4a33da7a5e3af43",
      "statement": "The panel is single-instance per machine, so parallel worktrees must not each keep a resident panel alive and real-machine verification uses `npm run accept`, whose accept mode bypasses the lock and can coexist with a running panel; the Startup shortcut `AGENT DECK.lnk` may only be created or taken over by a run whose app directory matches the declared `config.autostart.appDir`, so development worktrees never retarget the machine's autostart.",
